        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "We introduce the Clothing Attribute Dataset for promoting research in learning visual attributes for objects. The dataset contains 1856 images, with 26 ground truth clothing attributes such as \"long-sleeves\", \"has collar\", and \"striped pattern\". The labels were collected using Amazon Mechanical Turk.",
